## Authentication

Generate an API key at **Settings → API keys** in the dnswiz console. Pass it
via the `api_key` provider argument or the `DNSWIZ_API_KEY` environment
variable. The provider treats the value as sensitive.

Lock the key to a CIDR allow-list on the same screen if you only run
Terraform from known runners; the API enforces the allow-list and a 403
fires the moment the key is used from anywhere else.

