## Self-hosted dnswiz

Override the `endpoint` argument (or `DNSWIZ_ENDPOINT` env var) to point at
your own dnswiz install. Include the `/api` suffix:

```hcl
provider "dnswiz" {
  endpoint = "https://dnswiz.internal.example.com/api"
  api_key  = var.dnswiz_api_key
}
```

